benchfence 0.4.0-dev
commit:  497fce0
source:  lost. Projects were migrated from Codeberg to GitHub on 2026-09-29 because of
         Codeberg's anti-AI rules; benchfence's source did not survive the move.
built:   zig build release (static musl x86_64), stripped (~914K)

This is a vendored copy of the benchfence fencing engine — a single self-contained binary,
not a source tree. It records the exact fencer used to produce this repo's bench-results.
This binary is the only surviving copy: it cannot be rebuilt or refreshed.
What it does, as recovered from the binary: BENCHFENCE.md (beside this file).
RETIRED 2026-09-29: nothing in this repo runs it any more; kept only as the record of how
the v0.1–v0.3.1 numbers were measured. zsift now uses `zig build compare` (README, Measuring).
